  "stance": "orthodox",
  "bio": "<p>Eric Robles, also known by his iconic nicknames \"Terrible\" and \"Pantera,\" is a force to be reckoned with in the world of boxing. With over two decades of experience in the ring, Robles has proven himself to be a formidable opponent and a true champion.</p>\n\n<p>Robles earned the nickname \"Terrible\" for his relentless fighting style and his ability to strike fear into his opponents. Once he steps into the ring, he becomes a force of nature, leaving his opponents bewildered and overwhelmed.</p>\n\n<p>But it's not just his ferocity that sets Robles apart - he also possesses the grace and agility of a panther, which earned him the nickname \"Pantera.\" Like a predator stalking its prey, Robles moves with precision and finesse, always one step ahead of his opponents.</p>\n\n<p>Throughout his career, Robles has showcased his skills in various weight divisions, proving that he is a versatile boxer who can adapt to any challenge. From lightweight to welterweight, he has faced and conquered some of the best fighters in the world.</p>\n\n<p>Robles' impressive track record speaks for itself. With a string of victories and a minimal number of defeats, he has cemented his place as one of the greats in the sport. But it hasn't always been an easy journey for the boxer.</p>\n\n<p>Robles hails from a humble background, growing up in a rough neighborhood where boxing offered an escape from the harsh realities of his surroundings. It was through sheer determination and hard work that he made his way into the professional boxing scene.</p>\n\n<p>Robles' fighting style is a reflection of his personality - fearless, relentless, and unyielding. He possesses a rare combination of power and speed, allowing him to deliver devastating blows while evading his opponent's attacks with ease.</p>\n\n<p>But what truly sets Robles apart is his mental fortitude. In the midst of intense battles, he remains calm and composed, analyzing the situation and strategizing for the next move. It's this ability to stay focused under pressure that has led him to triumph time and time again.</p>\n\n<p>Robles' technique is a masterclass in the art of boxing. His footwork is precise, always positioning himself in the most advantageous angles to maximize the impact of his punches. His punches are swift and accurate, delivering maximum force with each strike.</p>\n\n<p>In addition to his physical prowess, Robles also possesses an astute understanding of the psychological aspect of the sport. He knows how to get into his opponent's head, using mind games and calculated taunts to unsettle them. This mental warfare often gives him the upper hand, allowing him to dictate the pace and flow of the fight.</p>\n\n<p>Outside of the ring, Robles is known for his humility and respect for his opponents. While he may be fierce inside the squared circle, he is always gracious in victory and defeat. His sportsmanship has earned him the admiration and respect of his peers and fans alike.</p>\n\n<p>As Robles continues his journey in the world of boxing, his legacy grows with each fight. His determination, skill, and unwavering spirit inspire aspiring boxers around the globe. Whether he is referred to as \"Terrible\" or \"Pantera,\" there is no denying Eric Robles' impact on the sport.</p>\n\n<p>So keep an eye out for this boxing sensation as he continues to prove that he is truly one of the greats. With his nicknames symbolizing his fierce fighting style and graceful movements, Eric Robles is ready to conquer the boxing world, one opponent at a time.</p>",
